  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nAs currently specified if you do nested calls to `requestClose()` for non-modal dialogs with no closedby attribute the dialog remains opened.\n\n```html\n<dialog open id=\"dialog\">Some Dialog Content</dialog>\n\n<script>\ndialog.oncancel = () => {\n   dialog.requestClose();\n};\ndialog.requestClose();\nconsole.log(dialog.open); // true\n</script>\n```",
